---
title: Dumplings
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Casseroles
cook time: 20 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@egg, slightly beaten{1}
@milk{0.5%cup}
@salt{0.5%tsp}
@flour

Mix ingredients and add enough flour to make a sticky, but not dry, dough. Drop by teaspoonfuls into rapidly boiling, salted water. Boil for about 20 minutes, covered. Do not peek or you will break the water seal. Drain. Good in stew or serve with melted butter.
